<title>DUBAI: Iran's NIOC lowers bunker fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Iran's NIOC lowers bunker fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Iranian Oil Company (NIOC) has set the price of its 280-cst bunker fuel oil from Kharg Island at $100.50 a tonne from a previous $102.</p>
<p>NIOC said the price of bunker fuel oil from Bandar Mahshahr was $96 from $98.</p>
<p>Prices are effective July 3, the company said.</p>
</text>
